<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-TWO PLAYERS SENT OFF IN BARCELONA MATCH.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TWO PLAYERS SENT OFF IN BARCELONA MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>BARCELONA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barcelona's Laurent Blanc was sent off in the 72nd minute and AIK Stockholms' Krister Nordin was sent off in the 75th minute in their European Cup Winners' Cup quarter-final, first leg game on Thursday.</p>
